# Files under web/ that are NOT part of the served site.
#
# `[assets]` in backend/wrangler.toml uploads this whole directory, and anything
# uploaded is PUBLIC — /parent/check-contrast.mjs would answer 200 to anyone.
# These are development tooling and notes, not pages, so they stay out of the
# deployment rather than being quietly reachable on api.ajar.family.
#
# .assetsignore is Cloudflare's own mechanism for this and lives in the assets
# directory itself:
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/binding/#ignoring-assets
**/README.md
**/*.mjs
